    "summary": "The South West State administration has announced ongoing joint security operations with the Federal Government in Buurhakaba, Bay region, following the entry of forces loyal to former leader Abdiaziz Hassan Mohamed Laftagareen. The administration stated it will not tolerate groups it accuses of cooperating with Al-Shabaab.",
